        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5059BA, Basel Leverset with Disk Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Transitional Basel Lever with Disk Rose has a retro feel thanks to the gentle tapering shape. The Basel Leverset with Disk Rose is a great way to add a little retro flair to your home but in a very contemporary way. This transitional door leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Brass Basel Door Lever with Round Disk Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Basel Leverset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n Levers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5059BA-finish.jpg?v=1704354563\" width=\"514\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
